flowchart TB
    A[Inbound message] --> B{Session already pinned\nto a failover group?}
    B -->|No| C[Pick failover group\ne.g. round-robin/random]
    B -->|Yes| D[Use previously pinned group]
    C --> E[Pin session to chosen group]
    E --> F
    D --> F[Try group's endpoint 1]
    F -->|fail| G[Try group's endpoint 2]
    F -->|success| H[Return response]
    G -->|success| H
    G -->|fail, group exhausted| I[Process error handler\nReturn SOAP fault: couldn't send message]
